d 'IMEUS2': module to install SSC routines 
d
d    imeus2} is a convenience command that accompanies	An
d Introduction to Modern Econometrics Using Stata, Second Edition, 
d by Christopher F. Baum (Stata Press, 2026).  The book's examples
d use several community-contributed Stata  commands that are
d available from the SSC archive. The {cmd:imeus2} command will
d automatically install the latest versions of these commands into
d the user's copy of Stata by using the official SSC command. 
d
d KW: community-contributed commands
d KW: IMEUS2
d
d Requires: Stata version 14 
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260726
d
d Author: Christopher F Baum, Boston College 
d Support: email baum@@bc.edu
d
f imeus2.ado
f imeus2.sthlp
